<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">Bugun: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">1 Thimothi</para>
  <para style="toc1">THIMOTHI shii Phaul re-è Igobi pha Jigigam</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Thimothi</para>
  <para style="toc3">1Thi</para>
  <para style="mt1">THIMOTHI</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shii Phaul Re-è Igobi Pha Jigigam</para>
  <para style="imt">Yaophi</para>
  <para style="ip">Thimothi ne, Asia Minor pha filiao masipho ro, airo amuii ne Jewish ro chiih-è airo aphuii ne Grekh ro. Ithong ro blia shii ai ne Phaul ro nongpho ro, <char style="bk">Igobi pha Phaul ro jigi Thimothi shii zey pha ji ne miigak um miyao rog shii isiie rek ne zey. </char></para>
  <para style="ip">Hì pha jigi shii igobi ne charch shii biidiie yua pho shii suang phriie ne zey ro. Hì pha muyua ne Jewthek nane Jewthek asi pho ro malaomajiao pha biidiiethek ji ro. Hì pha sohjambling ne awie rone migi rek, chiih-è ug pha khani ji ìd pha jia shii giawo mua bie, chiih-è chieniing pha ji thoh ne chiih-è ayiygey pha rek pho shii ne giawo muii ruii phro ne ji pha chiang shii yie srane biidiie muyua ji yua. Ji pha jigi shii de charch pha gayiig nane misiasia pha chiang shii yao ro, charch dumuiithek nane nongthek shii ziig pha ichua um chid phro ne dumdum shii yao muii ro. Idohhè shii, nyie khi-è-rek ne Isu Masi ro wie khiao rek chid chiih-è yoh-yoh ibrog migiphothek rog hà gajathek chiang shii Thimothi shii yua.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iliing shii um pha ji</para>
  <para style="io1">Yaophi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Yao pha jithek shii charch nane ophisphothek now yi <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TI 1:3-3:16">1:3—3:16</ref>) </char></para>
  <para style="io1">Hì pha blia chiang Thimothi shii yao <char style="ior">(<ref loc="1TI 4:1-6:21">4:1—6:21</ref>) </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1"/>Phaul re-è, Masi Isu ro guaphasamoy Hamangkhung-aphuii ro gethek shii ragia rek pha nane gethek ro luthong Masi Isu re-è ro,<verse eid="1TI 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:1">Blk 16:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Thimothi shii, migi pha guro zai dufuii: Aphuii Hamangkhung-aphuii nane Masi Isu gathek ro Ithong re-è na shii ne bushun, nane liijiing phi ro.<verse eid="1TI 1:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Biidiie yua pho shii phriie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3"/>Gu Mesidonia hà wuii shii gu è na shii khung ne yao pha ji duiine, gu ne na shii Iphisus hà rai bone yang muii ro. Giak bran è thiisa hàne biidiie pha muyuathek yua muii ro, chiih-è na ne ithek shii gak bo. <verse eid="1TI 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4"/>Ithek shii, jithek pha phaluiithek chiih-è blangthek ibengthek nyie ji ne khnaingthek rey khlei pha ji shii thoh yi pha yao bo; ithek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro phak nyie migi re-è thieg pha ji shii ne nyie blia oi ro. <verse eid="1TI 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5"/>Hì pha muyung chiang è igang lubu, sang munow, chiih-è isbang migi re-è khia pha miie shii dong khlei. <verse eid="1TI 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6"/>Giak bran ne ji re-è khid din chiih-è awie pha bi-ìe muphak pha lumuii hà san dun ro. <verse eid="1TI 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7"/>Ithek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro iphey pha masdothek rek yang, jishii ithek ne awaithek miyaogamthek shii agao ro chiih-è awaithek è nyie shii migi rog shii yao pha miyaothek chiang shii agao ro.<verse eid="1TI 1:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8"/>Gethek ne ìd Iphey shii wie re-è khoh arone Iphey ne wie ro. <verse eid="1TI 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9"/>Ji arone hì ne nowkhlei yi, iphey ji ne bran wie shii arab phi ro, jishii iphey chuipho shii nane suruii rek pho shii, chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii oi pho shii nane layogthek shii, chiih-è hanyie yi giang asi pho shii din ne ragung oi pho shii, chiih-è hanyie è awaithek aphuiithek amuiithek shii ua pho nane sgoh rek pho shii de, <verse eid="1TI 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10"/>chiih-è awie pha, chiih-è siulao rek pho, chiih-è zumphothek chiih-è biidiie yao chiih-è biidiie khagi rek chiih-è wie yua pha ji shii suang rek pho shii rab phi ro. <verse eid="1TI 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11"/>Ji pha muyua ne muawie shii doh muii ro, Hamangkhung-aphuii ro biisiie pha Mua Wie nane khirzey Hamangkhung-aphuii re-è gu shii yao bone phi ro.<verse eid="1TI 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hamangkhung-aphuii ro bushun shii chiong</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12"/>Gu ne hanyie è gu blia shii chua phi pha gathek ro Ithong Masi Isu shii lasothek phi. Gu ne aishii laso phi nyieliieshii ai è gu shii airo blia rek mua sapho jo phi ne gu shii gua phi.<verse eid="1TI 1:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:13: </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 8:3">Blk 8:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 9:4-5">9:4-5</ref></char>
    </note> Dohbi hàne gu è aishii awie pha yao ne diig phi ne makhak-riing. Jishii Hamangkhung-aphuii gu shii bushun rek phi nyieliieshii gu ne migi de oi ba chiih-è gu ne nyie rek pha ji ne gu ne athieg ba ro. <verse eid="1TI 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14"/>Chiih-è gethek Ithong ro bajo bushun gu lakhung shii phi chiih-è gethek ro Masi Isu rog shii ò rek pha ji re-è migi nane miie ne gethek shii chodang pha phi. <verse eid="1TI 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15"/>Hì ne zai yao, zab nuii ne migi rek chid phro: Masi Isu ne layogphothek shii ragia pha sohjambling shii wuii ro. Gu ithek è de buii ro, <verse eid="1TI 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16"/>jishii Masi Isu ro jum ne ley gu rog shii um rone Hamangkhung-aphuii ne gu shii bushun rek phi, layog è de bajo layog gui shii, doh hà hanyie re-è aishii migi rek ne chiih-è idang chai mua pho shii de miiriig rey dun phro. <verse eid="1TI 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17"/>Idang pha Saja, isieng nane adoh pha, Hamangkhung-aphuii bie, aishii ne idang pha idang ilab nane biisiie ro! Amen.<verse eid="1TI 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18"/>Thimothi, gu ani, nyie yi chaigthek re-è dohbi hà na chiang shii yaojong pha duiine hì pha muyung ne na shii phi phro. Ji pha miyaogamthek shii migiang duiine kho srane mak rek bo, <verse eid="1TI 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19"/>chiih-è nawai migi nane sang now pha ji shii ruii bo. Giak bran ne ithek ro now pha ji shii anuii chiih-è ithek ro migi shii mua maphi ro. <verse eid="1TI 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20"/>Ithek duchoi shii ne Hemenius nane Alezendar, hanyie shii gu è sakhathong pha blu shii phi srane lago phi; hì ne ithek ro makhak-riing pha ji shii gak yi pha yua ruii phro.<verse eid="1TI 1:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2"/>
  <para style="s">Charch pha misiasia</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1"/>Zab è igobi, chiihphado, gu ne hì yao misiathek, khungthek, chiih-è zab branthek chiang shii Hamangkhung-aphuii shii lasothek mizid bone ro; <verse eid="1TI 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2"/>sajathek chiih-è zab gaithek hanyie shii riichai umpha, ji è gethek aropha chiih-è liijiing re-è Hamangkhung-aphuii shii ilab rek rone wie giang re-è sieng mua phro. <verse eid="1TI 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3"/>Hì ne wie chiih-è gethek ro Ragia Hamangkhung-aphuii shii khung yi ro. <verse eid="1TI 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4"/>Ai ne zab shii ragia rek ne yang chiih-è zai shii ìd yi pha yang. <verse eid="1TI 2:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5"/>Chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii ne jia bie ro. Chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii nane branthek shii ò rek pha bran jia um ro, ji ne Masi Isu ro, <verse eid="1TI 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6"/>ai ne tharohthamang shii ichad rek phi pha awai shii phi muii. Jine khriig ishak shii khagi ro—Hamangkhung-aphuii è zab shii ragia rek phi pha yang <verse eid="1TI 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TI 1:11">2Thi 1:11</ref></char></note> chiih-è ji è gu shii ne migi nane izai pha mua ji yao yi pha Gaibranthek ro guaphasamoy nane masdo duiine thoh gey. Gu ne akhlam ro; gu ne izai yao ro!<verse eid="1TI 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8"/>Zab migipho ne alijieg pha chiih-è akhnaing pha wad chaing sia bone gu ne yang muii ro, hò-aphuiithek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii shii phi srane misia shii awaithek ro wad chiing ne lijieg nane akhnaing rabo. <verse eid="1TI 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:9: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 3:3">1Phth 3:3</ref> </char></note> Gu ne hì de yang muii ro hò-amuii ne yung guii shii de isiie re-è guii bo; duchung pho ro khaziang duiine asi pha chiih-è san mihen, mukhothek chiih-è igong pha yung guii ne achia rabo, <verse eid="1TI 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10"/>jishii wie blia re-è hanyie shii giangthek hò-amuii duiine ho muii pha ji ne zai lumuii ro. <verse eid="1TI 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11"/>Hò-amuii ne aropha chiih-è zab jum re-è dab bo. <verse eid="1TI 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12"/>Gu ne ithek shii yua pha de aphi chiih-è hò-aphuii lakhung shii riichai rek pha de aphi ro, ithek ne aro pha rai chid. <verse eid="1TI 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:7">Igo 2:7</ref>; </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 2:21-22">Igo 2:21-22</ref></char></note> Nyieliieshii Adam shii igobi rab chiih-è chiihphado Eve shii rab. <verse eid="1TI 2:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:14: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 3:1-6">Igo 3:1-6</ref></char></note> Chiih-è Adam shii akhin-rin ro; jishii hò-amuii shii khinrin rek chiih-è Hamangkhung-aphuii ro Iphey shii chui maphi pha ji ne hò-amuii ro. <verse eid="1TI 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15"/>Jishii ai ne migi rog shii chiih-è miie nane so bushun rog shii isiie rek chid arone<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ani re-è ragia rey ruii phro; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ne ani giak pha ji re-è ragia rey ruii phro.</char></note> hò-amuii ne ani giak pha ji re-è ragia rey ruii phro.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:15: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ai ne migi rog arone; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ithek migi rog arone.</char></note><verse eid="1TI 2:15"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3"/>
  <para style="s">Charch pha dumuiithek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1"/>Hì ne izai yao ro: hò-aphuii ne charch pha dumuii rek yang arone ai ne wie blia shii chid ro <verse eid="1TI 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:2-7: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="TIT 1:6-9">Thd 1:6-9</ref></char></note> Charch pha dumuii ne ichiig oi pha um chid; ai ne yiy jia um bie chid,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:2: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ai ne yiy jia um bie chid; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Luang jia yiygey bie chid.</char></note> ai ne ichiig pha, zud ne; ikhiing re-è rek ne ai ne awai hò shii awaithek bran shii wieho chid; ai ne yua mua chid; <verse eid="1TI 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3"/>ai ne phuii aniing pha chiih-è buii bran asi pha, jishii jum nane liijiing um chid; ai ne bang shii de amiie chid; <verse eid="1TI 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4"/>ai ne awai haliing shii de wie gayiig mua chid chiih-è awai aniphiing shii de zab pha lumuii shii awai shii nuii yi chid. <verse eid="1TI 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5"/>Hò-aphuii yi awai haliing shii isiie rek pha athieg arone, nyie khi-è-rek ne Hamangkhung-aphuii ro charch shii gayiig mua magey phlei? <verse eid="1TI 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6"/>Ai ne migi shii de weg um chid, ji è ai ne nyigodog shii aphieng pha chiih-è Sakhathong duiine athe rabo. <verse eid="1TI 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7"/>Ai ne charch è fuangpha bran è de ilab rek pha hò-aphuii um chid, ji è ai ne ìu arey pha chiih-è Sakhathong ibong shii aphang ruii phro.<verse eid="1TI 3:7"/></para>
  <para style="s">Charch pha nongphothek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8"/>Charch pha nongphothek ne ziig chiih-è isiie ne wie um chid; ithek ne phuii de aniing chiih-è bang de asgow chid; <verse eid="1TI 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9"/>ithek ne isang lubu munow rog shii migi re-è zai dong pha ji shii chuh re-è kho chid. <verse eid="1TI 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10"/>Ithek shii ne igobi chai chid, chiih-è chiihphado, chai pha ji re-è hiìa ge arone, ithek ne blia rek chid. <verse eid="1TI 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11"/>Ithek ro yiythek<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ithek ro yiythek; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Hò-amuii nongphothek.</char></note> de wie ziig nane amshiiy-alawoi pha um chid; ithek ne zab shii athiigpha nane isiie um chid. <verse eid="1TI 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12"/>Charch pha nongphothek ne yiy jia um bie chid,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:12: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Yiy jia um bie chid; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Luang jia yiygey bie chid.</char></note> chiih-è awai aniphiing nane awai haliing shii wie re-è gayiig rek mua chid. <verse eid="1TI 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13"/>Nongphothek hanyie è awaithek blia shii wie rek ne awaithek shii wie ithua mua ge, chiih-è awaithek ro migi Masi Isu shii um pha chiang shii lububo è yao mua ro.<verse eid="1TI 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Bajobo ug pha ji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14"/>Gu è na shii hì pha jigi zey pha duiine, gu ne khthiie wuii ne riig pha luthong ro. <verse eid="1TI 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15"/>Jishii gu chiadun arone, isieng Hamangkhung-aphuii pha charch, ji ne izai pha sarong nongpho ro Hamangkhung-aphuii ro hò shii ne nyie khi-è-rek ne gethek chung ziig rek rai pha ji hì pha jigi è ìd ruii. <verse eid="1TI 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16"/>Khama Bajobo pha ug nane gethek ro giang shii ne hanyie jia de asnai mua phro:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">ai ne tharohthamang rey ne dong khlei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">Ragung re-è rangsua rone doh yie,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:16: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Ragung re-è rangsua rone doh yie; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Chiih-è, Ragung è, rone doh yi pha ji ne izai.</char></note></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">chiih-è khliiethek è aishii doh.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Ai chiang shii ne soh duchoi shii yua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">Zab pha sohjambling è aishii migi rek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">chiih-è aishii ne hamangkhung hà noh dun.<verse eid="1TI 3:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4"/>
  <para style="s">Biidiie pha masdothek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1"/>Ragung è sang yao giak branthek ne thog ruii pha ishakthek shii ne migi thoh ruii phro; ithek ne biidiie pha ragungthek shii nuii ne ibuiithek è yua pha ji shii lua ruii phro. <verse eid="1TI 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2"/>Ji è rek pha yuathek ne shiie chieg rog shii ziao pha duiine khinrin pha khlampho è shiiy ro, ithek munowthek ne iy-iy ro. <verse eid="1TI 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3"/>Jithek pha branthek yua yiygey nane ji pha giak michiethek chie phane ichiig ro. Jishii Hamangkhung-aphuii è jithek pha michie ne hanyie yi migiphothek nane izai shii thiegpho ne lasothek misia pha iidoh ne chie pha rab phi ro. <verse eid="1TI 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii miirab pha zab ne wie ro, snai pha ne nyie de oi, jishii zab ne lasothek pha misia rog shii choi ro, <verse eid="1TI 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5"/>nyieliieshii Hamangkhung-aphuii ro miyaogam nane misia ne Hamangkhung-aphuii shii choi ro.<verse eid="1TI 4:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Masi Isu ro khiao wie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6"/>Na è migiphothek shii hì yua arone, na ne Masi Isu ro khiao wie rey ruii phro, na ne nawai giang pha miyaogam pha migi nane izai re-è yua pha ji shii nawai ragungthek shii wang pha duiine ro. <verse eid="1TI 4:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii oi pha phaluii è ruang rek bo, nyieliieshii hì ne nyie blia oi ro. Nawai shii hamangkhung-aphuii chai ji è dab ne rai bo. <verse eid="1TI 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8"/>Siu pha blia shii de nyie magunde bid um ro, jishii ragung pha blia zab pha lumuii shii ne zab shii wie ro, jimagunde ji ne thuh nane phariang pha chai nyimanyi shii sbang rek ro. <verse eid="1TI 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9"/>Hì ne zab shii nuii ne chiih-è migi rek pha izai miyao ro. <verse eid="1TI 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10"/>Gathek ne diig<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:10: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Diig; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">giak jigizey shii ne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Suang um.</char></note> rek ne blia gang rek, nyieliieshii gathek ro luthong ne isieng Hamangkhung-aphuii shii ruii, ai ne zab ro Ragia ro, hanyie è migi rek pha ji pho ro.<verse eid="1TI 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11"/>Ithek shii hì pha miyaothek nane yuathek ji phi magey bo. <verse eid="1TI 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12"/>Nyieliieshii na filiao pha ji è hanyie de na shii luii ariig yi rabo, jimagunde migiphothek shii naro miyao, naro blia, naro miie, naro migi, nane gang shii khagi rek bo. <verse eid="1TI 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13"/>Idohhè gu wuii ruii shii, nathek ro ishak phi ne branthek moe shii jigithek tham ne yao, na ne yua pha ji shii snak rek bo. <verse eid="1TI 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14"/>Nyie chaigthek è yaojong pha nane dukhothek è wad nathek lakhung shii ruii shii nathek shii phijong pha ragung lasen ji shii asnai rabo. <verse eid="1TI 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15"/>Nawai ro ibi rey pha ji shii zab doh yi pha hì thek pha manathek shii rek bo ji è zab ne nawaithek shii doh muii ruii phro. <verse eid="1TI 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16"/>Nawai shii riig ne nawai muyua ji shii riig bo. Hì pha bliathek shii rek ne rai bo, nyieliieshii nathek rek arone, nyimanyi nawai nane hanyie è na shii yoi pha ji shii de ragia rey ruii phro.<verse eid="1TI 4:16"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5"/>
  <para style="s">Migiphothek ro gajathek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1"/>Firiangweg shii agiung rabo, jishii aishii ne nawai aphuii duiine yao bo. Nawai è filiao bran shii nawaithek khuiinothek duiine rek bo, <verse eid="1TI 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2"/>miriangweg ne nawaithek amuiithek duiine, chiih-è mileo bimithek shii nawaithek bumuiithek duiine, zab gang rog shii rek bo.<verse eid="1TI 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3"/>Misiungthek hanyie yi zab re-è zai awaithek ji lei ne ithek shii ne ilab phi bo. <verse eid="1TI 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4"/>Jishii misiung shii aniphiing nane chem um arone, ithek ne awaithek haliing pha awaithek ro giang bliathek ji igobi rek srane, chiih-è ji duiine awaithek aphuii-amuii nane achinmoi shii ilab rek din ruii phro, nyieliieshii ji ne Hamangkhung-aphuii è chid pha ji ro. <verse eid="1TI 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5"/>Misiung hanyie yi aishii nong pha hanyie oi pha awai ji pho ne, awairo luthong ne Hamangkhung-aphuii rog shii chiih-è misia ne awai shii nong phi pha hanai nane habiu Hamangkhung-aphuii shii athodang pha lea bo. <verse eid="1TI 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6"/>Jishii misiung hanyie è awai chid pha ji igobi phi arone, ai ne isieng magunde iyjong pha duiine ro. <verse eid="1TI 5:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7"/>Hì pha muyua ne ithek shii phi bo, ji è hanyie jia magunde ithek rog shii ichiig arey. <verse eid="1TI 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8"/>Jishii hanyie jia de awaithek ro siangthang shii gayiig arek arone, nyayaochak shii ne awaithek ro haliing pha branthek shii arek arone ithek ne migi shii snai ne migi arekpho è de awiedang pha rey dun ro.<verse eid="1TI 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9"/>Misiung ne idam sariig arey sapho shiine thaluii misiungmuii rog shii lao ne sasab arek rabo. Hìde lao ne ai ne luang jia yiygeyjong bie chid<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:9: </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Luang jia yiygeyjong bie chid; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">dinne </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Awai gey shii migi rek chid.</char></note> <verse eid="1TI 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10"/>chiih-è wie rek pha ibeng um chid: hò-amuii hanyie è awai anithek shii wie re-è ram phone, biwen shii awai hò hà choi ne, gai Masiphothek blia pha jum bliathek rek ne, diig shii branthek shii nong chiih-è awai shii wie blia rek bsa hà phi ro.<verse eid="1TI 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11"/>Jishii mileo misiung shii ne sasab arek rabo; nyieliieshii ithek ne siu re-è yang pha ji thog arone, ithek ne Masi re-è iidoh khid din magey phro, <verse eid="1TI 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12"/>chiih-è ithek ro igobi pha aishii sbang rek pha ji chui pha ichiig rey ruii phro. <verse eid="1TI 5:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13"/>Ithek de hò-hò lua ne ishak mua pha ji dab muii ro; ithek ne ayao pha miyao shii de gachithek yao rone ji è de awie pha rek gai ro blia shii de snak rek pha dab ro. <verse eid="1TI 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14"/>Ji-è gu ne yang mileo misiungthek ne yiygey ne, aniphiing de um bo, chiih-è awaithek hòthek shii gayiig rek bo. Ji anine gethek ro makthek buii de ayao muii. <verse eid="1TI 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15"/>Giak misiungthek ne sakhathong shii gieng pha yiejong ro. <verse eid="1TI 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16"/>Jishii hanyie Masipho hò-amuii ro haliing shii misiung um arone, ai ne ithek shii gayiig chid chiih-è charch shii miihan aphi chid, ji anine charch re-è misiungmuii hanyie ai ne ji lie ne aishii ne gayiig mua.<verse eid="1TI 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17"/>Dukhothek hanyie è diig rek rone dumuii blia wie rek pho shii ne gai re-è huàk ne choi chid nyayaochak arone yao pho nane yua pho shii mua chid phro. <verse eid="1TI 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:18: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:4">Iphy 25:4</ref> </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:10">Mth 10:10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:7">Lug 10:7</ref> </char></note> Jigi shii yao, rawoi yi iwoi nan ramuii shii iphab aphang rabo chiih-è “bliapho ne awaithek ro mathang shii ne phi chid.” <verse eid="1TI 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 17:6">Iphy 17:6</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 19:15">19:15</ref></char></note>Dukhothek shii suang the pha ji shii ne nyi re-è muna khagithek oi sapho shii ne anuii rabo. <verse eid="1TI 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20"/>Hanyie è layog rekpho shii ne branthek moe shii giung bo, ji anine gaithek de rum ruii phro.<verse eid="1TI 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21"/>Hamangkhung-aphuii chiih-è Masi Isu nane so hamangkhliiethek moe shii, nathek è nyie rek pha ji shii ne giak shii haro rek giak shii haro arek pha ji arek yi hì yao pha ji nuii yi pha gu nathek shii surua rek ne yao ro. <verse eid="1TI 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22"/>Ithong ro blia rek pho ithek shii phi muii pha branthek shii wad ruii pha khthiie arek rabo. Gaithek ro layog shii ichua ayie rabo; nawai shii igang ruii bo.<verse eid="1TI 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23"/>Kho aniing bie rabo, jishii na bleb-bleb rad pha ji re-è nawai luiriie pha ji shii nong pha angurphuii ìujia niing magey bo.<verse eid="1TI 5:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24"/>Giak branthek ro layogthek ne miang doh, chiih-è ithek ro layogthek ne ibi hàne awaithek shii chua ruii phro; jishii giak ro layogthek ne dohrasey re-è doh bie ruii phro. <verse eid="1TI 5:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25"/>Ji duiine wie blia ne miang doh, chiih-è miang adoh pha ji ne a-ug mua phro.<verse eid="1TI 5:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1"/>Hanyie yi khiaothek lei ne ai ne awaithek masdo shii isiie re-è ilab phi chid, ji è hanyie magunde Hamangkhung-aphuii ibeng nane gethek è yua pha ji shii ne wie asi rone ayao mua. <verse eid="1TI 6:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2"/>Masipho masdo re-è rey pha khiaothek shii muriig-achiing pha arek rabo, chiih-è ithek ne migiphothek ro. Ji phachiang, ithek ne awaithek chung din è de huak ne blia rek, nyieliieshii ithek ro blia re-è phua pho ne ithek è miie pha migiphothek ji ro.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1TI 6:2">Biidiie yua pha nane izai bukhothek</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Nathek ne hì thek zab shii yao ne yua chid. <verse eid="1TI 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3"/>Hanyie è yoh miyao shii yua chiih-è Ithong Masi Isu ro izai miyaogamthek rog shii anuii arone chiih-è gethek ro yua pha giang re-è yoh ro. <verse eid="1TI 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4"/>Nyigodog shii phieng srane nyie de athieg ro. Aishii ne miyaogamthek chiang shii khnaing ne gui noh pha awie pha chid pha ji um ro, chiih-è ji ne miegriie, guipha, makhak-riing awie pha munow shii yie ro, <verse eid="1TI 6:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5"/>chiih-è khanithek yi blia aphi pha chiih-è izai oi pha branthek è ne bleb-bleb khnaing ro. Ithek ne giang yi bukho rek pha lumuii rone now ro. <verse eid="1TI 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6"/>Wie, gethek shii nyie um pha jishii khriig arone giang re-è ne gethek shii bajo bukho rab phi. <verse eid="1TI 6:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7"/>Gethek ne sohjambling shii nyie yie? Nyie de asi ro! Gethek ne sohjambling è nyie yie ne dun phlei? Nyie de asi ro. <verse eid="1TI 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8"/>Ji-è chiihphado, gethek shii michie nane yung um arone ji ne gethek shii khriig ro. <verse eid="1TI 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9"/>Jishii hanyie yi bukho mua yang arone chuajan shii chiih ne awie pha nane bajo bi-ìe nane chidthek shii mua dun pha ibong shii phang ne, nyie yi awie pha nane mua pha ji shii reng ruii. <verse eid="1TI 6:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10"/>Chiih-è bang shii miie phane zab awie ichuathek pha iikhiing ro. Giak ne ji shii mua pha yang chiih-è ji pha chiang shii ithek ne migi pha lumuii ji è ruang rey dun, chiih-è ithek ne bajo duhug um srane ithek ro lubuthek ne chuidun.<verse eid="1TI 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Hanyiehanyie ro miyuathek</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11"/>Jishii, Hamangkhung-aphuii ro bran, hì thek zab shii thoh muii bo. Giangthek, hamangkhung-aphuii duiine, migi, miie, zud, chiih-è zum shii mua pha bidiang bo. <verse eid="1TI 6:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12"/>Nawaithek ro migi shii khama ran mua pha ji ran bo, chiih-è nawaithek ne idang pha chai shii yang bo; chiih-è nawaithek ro migi yi bajo khagi pha ibi shii chuh è nuii magey shii Hamangkhung-aphuii è hì pha chai hà ho ro. <verse eid="1TI 6:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:13: </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 18:37">Jon 18:37</ref></char></note>Hamangkhung-aphuii moe shii, hanyie è chai ne zab manathek shii phi, chiih-è Masi Isu ibi, hanyie è awai migi shii chuh re-è Phonthius Philath ibi shii nuii bone, gu nathek shii yung <verse eid="1TI 6:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14"/>chiih-è nathek shii phi pha muyung shii nuii bo, chiih-è Ithong Isu Masi yi khia pha Inai thogdang pha ithek shii isiie ruii bo. <verse eid="1TI 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15"/>Airo khia pha ji ne khirzeyley pha Hamangkhung-aphuii nane khopho jia bie pha chiih-è Saja pha sajathek chiih-è Ithong pha Ithongthek è khriig ishak shii yie ruii phro. <verse eid="1TI 6:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16"/>Awai ji jia idang-idang isieng rai bie; ai ne hanyie jia de athog muii pha isang hà rai. Hanyie jia de aishii ariig ro; hanyie jia de aishii adoh mua. Ilab nane idang pha blu ne airo ro! Amen.<verse eid="1TI 6:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17"/>Hanyie shii hì pha chai pha mana bukho um pho shii nyigodog arek rabone yung bo, jishii ithek ro luthong pha ji ne thaluii pha mana bukho shii arek rabo, jishii hanyie è gethek shii zab pha lubo yie phi pha Hamangkhung-aphuii shii rek bo. <verse eid="1TI 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18"/>Wie blia boh chiih-è bliathek shii bukho rey yi bo, chiih-è lubusua rek ne gai rog shii thang bo ithek shii yung bo. <verse eid="1TI 6:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19"/>Ji duiine ithek ne nuruii awaithek ro khrab yi bone nyie yi phariang pha wie ii-àk sarong rey ruii. Chiih-è ji è ithek ne nyie izai chai shii yang muii ruii phro.<verse eid="1TI 6:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20"/>Thimothi, nyie yi na shii gayiig pha phi pha ji shii ne wie re-è ragia rek bo. Hamangkhung-aphuii shii makhak-riing pha miyao ruang ruii bo chiih-è branthek ne khani rone yao pha bi-ìe khnaing pha ji re-è ruang rai bo. <verse eid="1TI 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21"/>Giak ne ji um rone yao, chiih-è ji pha chiang è ithek ne migi pha lumuii shii ne sanmuii.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Hamangkhung-aphuii ro bushun ne nathek zab rog shii um bo.<verse eid="1TI 6:21"/></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6"/>
</usx>
